detaileddescription.para:
For every key in File::get() writes "stem.lua" to
@c File::path if not already present on disk. Then writes every
@c Graphics stem (e.g. @"tab_bar.svg") to the SVG subdirectory pointed at by the ID::path property of the live IDtype::graphics subtree, if not already present. Files already on disk are left untouched — this is a seed-once walk, not a forced overwrite.
